# Citation metadata, in Citation File Format 1.2.0.
# GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository".
#
# No release has been published and there is no DOI. `version` names the
# current unreleased version so a citation is unambiguous about what it saw.
#
# `license` is the code license. Datasets minted from this repository carry
# CC-BY-4.0, which is recorded in LICENSE-DATASETS.md and written into every
# manifest. The format has one license field, so this is the one it holds.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: 'Mintmark insurance: synthetic Turkish policy and claim records'
abstract: 'Declaration-and-data pack producing synthetic Turkish insurance records: policyholders,
  policies, claims, payments, and free-text claim notes and call transcripts. Includes a health
  branch held at category granularity by two controls. Not clinical data. Requires the Mintmark
  engine.'
type: dataset
version: 0.1.2
authors:
